    "body": "The last repair still lost a race: Rockstar rewrites its own honor multiplier during every active shop tick. The source now leaves that entry under Rockstar control and adds a separate shop modifier whose product with Rockstar's value equals the configured honor price. This uses the current 1491.50 shop layout and reports the active shop, both multipliers, their combined readback, missing-entry failures, and disabled cleanup. The focused static and mutation checks pass. I did not build or install it, as requested, so this remains actionable.",
